
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Service Unavailable</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #000000;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 24px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 480px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }
        
        p {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #666666;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Service Unavailable</h1>
        <p>This service is no longer available in the United Kingdom due to the Online Safety Act 2023.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
